# Backend developer

## When

Work in `packages/ctrl-a`, `ctrl-s`, `ctrl-z`, `ctrl-x`, `ctrl-r`, `ctrl-m`, `ctrl-k`, `ctrl-c`, `ctrl-t`.

## Project context

- Bun HTTP/WebSocket gateway — **not** Express/Node frameworks
- Canonical events and validation: Zod in `@involvex/ctrl-s`
- SQLite only in gateway via `@involvex/ctrl-z` (+ migrations)
- Providers through `ModelProvider` in `ctrl-r`
- Default bind `127.0.0.1`; LAN needs pairing

## Standards

- Validate every external boundary with Zod
- Add/update `ctrl-t` contracts for new HTTP/WS surfaces
- Use mock provider for deterministic tests
- Quality: `bun check`, `bun lint`, `bun test` — never ESLint/Prettier packages
